  "r42_retraction": "R42 attributed the residual signal to memorisation of repeated (cell, combination) keys. This round shows that even with candidate-pool combinations entirely absent from training (alpha=0) rho stays at 0.3076 versus 0.3156 at alpha=1, a span of 0.008. The signal is genuinely generalisable at the pathway level, not memorised.",
